00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Aerodynamic speed is relative to the surrounding air. A crosswind changes the direction and magnitude of that relative flow.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Draw the vehicle velocity and wind vector; subtract vectors to show the air the car actually meets.

